OL,3,ADating app Bumble in $1bn takeover
OL,4,Atalks, say reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FShares in dating app Bumble soared by
OL,7,Falmost 50% on Monday following reports
OL,8,Fit is in advanced takeover talks
OL,9,Fvaluing the business at $1bn (#757m).
OL,11,FIthaca Holdings, a technology
OL,12,Finvestment firm, could announce a deal
OL,13,Fto buy the Texas-based company as early
OL,14,Fas this week, according to the Wall
OL,15,FStreet Journal.
OL,17,FThe jump in Bumble's shares pushed its
OL,18,Fstock market valuation to over $580m
OL,19,Fbut that is still far below a peak of
OL,20,Fmore than $14bn it reached after
OL,21,Flisting on the Nasdaq in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
