OL,3,ABBC shelves plans for new Archers
OL,4,Astudio as part of cost-cutting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has shelved plans to build a
OL,7,Fnew bespoke studio for The Archers in
OL,8,FBirmingham as part of its wider drive
OL,9,Fto cut costs, opening up the
OL,10,Fpossibility it could be recorded
OL,11,Foutside the city for the first time.
OL,13,FThe world's longest-running soap opera,
OL,14,FThe Archers has been recording in the
OL,15,FWest Midlands city for 75 years.
OL,17,FThe BBC had initially pledged to build
OL,18,Fthe show a new studio in the Tea
OL,19,FFactory, the corporation's new hub in
OL,20,FDigbeth, central Birmingham.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
