OL,3,ABBC shelves plans for new Archers
OL,4,Astudio as part of cost-cutting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe broadcaster said it was "currently
OL,7,Fassessing the BBC's existing studio
OL,8,Ffacilities around the UK as well as
OL,9,Fother external studio options in the
OL,10,FWest Midlands".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
